    {
      "name": "@dsh-dock/file-manager",
      "title": {
        "en": "Server file manager",
        "zh": "服务器文件管理"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "A file manager page in the left sidebar for the whole server. Browse any readable directory with breadcrumbs, a path bar you can type into, and shortcut chips; open text, images, and PDFs inline; upload files (button or drag-and-drop), download files, create folders, rename, and delete. It is not tied to a workspace or Session. Paths are checked on the Host against the configured roots; by default the whole filesystem is browsable and writable by the DSH process user, so change roots or allowOutsideRoots in the plugin's config to narrow it. Uploads are capped at 1 GiB per request.",
        "zh": "左侧栏里的整台服务器文件管理页面。通过面包屑、可直接输入的路径栏和快捷入口浏览任意可读目录；内联预览文本、图片和 PDF；上传（按钮或拖拽）、下载文件，新建文件夹、重命名和删除。它不绑定工作区或会话。所有路径都在 Host 端按配置的根目录校验；默认可以浏览并写入 DSH 进程用户有权限访问的整个文件系统，可在插件配置里收窄 roots 或关闭 allowOutsideRoots。单次上传上限 1 GiB。"
      },
      "author": "DSH Dock",
      "homepage": "https://github.com/wangchengxin666/dsh-dock/tree/main/plugins/file-manager",
      "icon": "data:image/svg+xml;base64,",
